ians know which parts actually fail. The parts team knows which substitutions work. But none of that knowledge is in the process. It’s in the people. And when those people leave, the operation gets slower and more expensive."}]]]}]}]}],["$","section",null,{"className":"py-20 bg-gray-50","children":["$","div",null,{"className":"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8","children":[["$","h2",null,{"className":"font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl text-navy-900 mb-6","children":["PROCESSES: ","INDUSTRIAL TECHNOLOGY"," OPERATIONS"]}],["$","div",null,{"className":"bg-gold-600 h-1 w-24 mb-12"}],["$","div",null,{"className":"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6","children":[["$","div","0",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl text-navy-900 font-bold mb-3","children":"Service Request Intake & Triage"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Receiving, categorizing, and prioritizing service requests across channels and contract types. The process that determines whether field service starts with clarity or with guesswork."}]]}],["$","div","1",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":[["$","h3",null,{"className":"font-display text-xl text-navy-900 font-bold mb-3","children":"Warranty & Entitlement Verification"}],["$","p",null,{"className":"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed","children":"Determining coverage status, contract terms, and service entitlements for incoming requests. The process where billing accuracy begins — or where revenue leakage starts."}]]}],["$","div","2",{"className":"bg-white border-2 border-gray-200 p-8 hover:border-gold-600 transition-colors","children":["$L2","$L3"]}],"$L4","$L5","$L6","$L7","$L8","$L9","$La","$Lb","$Lc","$Ld","$Le"]}]]}]}],"$Lf","$L10","$L11"]}],null,"$L12"]}],"isPartial":false,"staleTime":300,"varyParams":null,"buildId":"JZFBvPRiCrOp_5IQLtmj_"}
